<title>USA: Czech Industries holders to vote on split.</title>
<headline>Czech Industries holders to vote on split.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Industries Inc said it has called a special meeting of shareholders to be held on September 10 to approve a one-for-five reverse stock split.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the reverse split, the company will have 2,871,000 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said it has detailed the several purposes of the reverse split in a proxy statement mailed to shareholders today.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
